{"parents": [{"link": "../../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../../", "title": "Auth0 Fastapi"}, {"link": "../", "title": "Stores"}], "prev": {"link": "../cookie_transaction_store/", "title": "Cookie Transaction Store"}, "next": {"link": "../stateless_state_store/", "title": "Stateless State Store"}, "title": "Stateful State Store", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store\">\n<span id=\"stateful-state-store\"></span><h1>Stateful State Store<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>A state store implementation that persists session data in a backend store</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cookie_name</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'_a0_session'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">expiration</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">259200</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/#StatefulStateStore\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.store.abstract.StateStore</span></code></p>\n<p>A state store implementation that persists session data in a backend store\n(for example, Redis or a database). It uses a cookie to keep track of the session ID.\nThe underlying session store must implement asynchronous get, set, delete, and keys methods.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>secret</strong> \u2013 Secret for encryption (if needed)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store</strong> \u2013 The persistent session store (e.g., a Redis client wrapper)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>cookie_name</strong> \u2013 Name of the cookie holding the session identifier</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>expiration</strong> \u2013 Session expiration time in seconds</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.delete\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/#StatefulStateStore.delete\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Deletes state data from the session store and clears the session cookie.\nExpects \u2018response\u2019 in options.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.delete_by_logout_token\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete_by_logout_token</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/#StatefulStateStore.delete_by_logout_token\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.delete_by_logout_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Delete sessions matching the logout token claims.</p>\n<p>Per the OIDC Back-Channel Logout spec, either <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sid</span></code> or <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sub</span></code>\n(or both) will be present.  Matching uses OR logic: a session\nis considered a match if either claim matches.</p>\n<p>When <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">iss</span></code> is present in claims, the token\u2019s issuer is validated\nagainst the session\u2019s stored domain before deletion.\nThis prevents cross-domain session deletion in MCD deployments.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.get\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.StateData</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/#StatefulStateStore.get\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Retrieves state data from the underlying session store using the session cookie.\nExpects \u2018request\u2019 in options.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.set\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.StateData</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">remove_if_exists</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/#StatefulStateStore.set\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Stores state data in the underlying session store and sets a cookie with the session ID.\nExpects \u2018response\u2019 in options.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.cookie_name\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cookie_name</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'_a0_session'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.cookie_name\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.expiration\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expiration</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">259200</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.expiration\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.secret\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.secret\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.store\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">store</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.store\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateless_state_store/index", "Stateless State Store", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth0_fastapi/stores/cookie_transaction_store/index", "Cookie Transaction Store", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Stateful State Store</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.delete\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.delete()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.delete_by_logout_token\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.delete_by_logout_token()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.get\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.get()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.set\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.set()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.cookie_name\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.cookie_name</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.expiration\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.expiration</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.secret\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.secret</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.stores.stateful_state_store.StatefulStateStore.store\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StatefulStateStore.store</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateful_state_store/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/ethical-ads.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html", "sidebar/variant-selector.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#f2f2f2", "foreground": "#1e1e1e"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}